# Byte-for-byte fidelity: disable end-of-line conversion for every file so that
# MANIFEST.sha256 verifies identically on any machine, whatever core.autocrlf
# the cloner happens to have. Text files therefore keep the line endings they
# were archived with.
* -text

# Binary artefacts (also excluded from diff and merge).
*.pt    binary
*.npz   binary
*.png   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.tgz   binary
*.zip   binary
